    "infoQueEs": "What is MoMoEST?",
    "infoQueEsM": "MoMoEST (Modern Movement Educational Semantic Tool) is a distributed application that uses Open Data from different sources to support ubiquitous learning. Through MoMoEST you can add new learning resources and carry out learning tasks (registered users). This tasks can be designed to be completed close to the site or from any location.",
    "infoLod": "MoMoEST uses Open Data",
